			description: [
				"Join the same FTB Team before pushing deeply into the guide. Quest progress can be shared, but discoveries are more memorable when everyone understands what was found and why it matters."
				"Split useful roles without locking anyone into a job: one person can map, another cook, another build, and another learn Create. Rotate whenever somebody wants to try something new."
