		{
			dependencies: ["3522AB4192F75013"]
			description: [
				"This chronicle connects the pack's dimensions, ruins, machines and ecosystems into one shared story. It is our world's field-guide lore, not a replacement for the official canon of each mod."
				"Long ago, separate ages left traces in the same world: old roads, buried halls, impossible caves and gateways to places with different rules. The group has inherited those traces without inheriting their explanations."
				"Your task is not to conquer everything. It is to learn what each place asks of you, bring that knowledge home, and leave the world more understandable than you found it."
			]
